# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers from a Windows checkout. A CR in a
# shebang makes the interpreter "not found", which reports as exit code 127 and
# looks nothing like a line-ending problem.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The founder's word list is embedded byte for byte and checked against the
# published list's digest: a CRLF checkout on Windows changed every line, and
# the digest with it (CI, 2026-11-25).
crates/identity/src/bip39-english.txt text eol=lf
